5. Test the AI service separately
With Ollama installed and the model downloaded, check that its local API responds:
curl http://localhost:11434/api/tags


This should return a list of downloaded models. You can test a prompt without opening the interactive model session:
curl http://localhost:11434/api/chat \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"model":"qwen3:1.7b","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Hello, A.D.A."}],"stream":false}'


The model name must match the model you downloaded. Ollama's official model page documents this model and its command-line usage. 

